mbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220110.jpg"},{"title":"Cyandog Bites Back","synopsis":"Spyke and Cyandog never seem to win a Ro-Battle so Samantha kicks him them out of the Screws gang. Spyke and Cyandog ask Metabee and Ikki for training help and they find out that Cyandog is terrible at battle because he has the wrong type of medal.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220111.jpg"},null,null,{"title":"Mystery Medabot","synopsis":"A mysterious Medabot has come to town. This Medabot goes by the name Rokusho. Ikki and his pals see him saving a puppy and they realise that he is faster than any Metabot they ever seen. Metabee finds out that Rokusho is a loner Medabot with his past shrouded in mystery.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220114.jpg"},{"title":"Phantom Renegade: Unmasked","synopsis":"Ikki is accused to be the Phantom Renagade by a reporter, so the reporter follows him everywhere and even starts to mimic the Phantom in the hopes that Ikki will reveal his secret. But then the real Phantom comes out into the open seeking revenge.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220115.jpg"},{"title":"Ban All Medabots","synopsis":"Angry moms that don't like Medabots are stealing kids' Medabots and pack them away. Ikki and Metabee talk some sense to the mean mothers and they get a grip and everyone lives happily ever after. For now, anyway.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220116.jpg"},{"title":"Meet Your Meda-Maker","synopsis":"The Rubber Robo Gang comes up with a plan to use Ikki and Metabee to steal a super rare medal from Dr. Aki him self, who is the creator of all Medabots and also Karin's uncle.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220117.jpg"},{"title":"The Spy Who Robattled Me","synopsis":"The Rubber Robo Gang tries to steal a rare medal from the Medabot Corporation. Inside, the Rubber Robo Gang steals Belzega, a Medabot that has one-hit-beats-him attack. Dr. Aki, realizing that the Rubber Robo Gang wants all the rare medals of the world, appoints the Phantom Renegade to protect them.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220118.jpg"},{"title":"I Dream of Hushi","synopsis":"Rokusho meets Ainsley, a woman that lost her husband in a war, and they start to become friends.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220119.jpg"},{"title":"Metabee vs. Rokusho","synopsis":"Rokusho finds out that Dr. Aki was the one that set fire to Dr. Hushi's house and Rokusho gets very angry. Metabee tries to protect Dr. Aki and has to Ro-Battle Rokusho. When Metabee is about to win, Rokusho uses the 'Medaforce' to pummel Metabee into oblivion.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220120.jpg"},null,{"title":"Fifteen Minutes of Shame","synopsis":"The preliminary rankings for top Medafighters off Japan is out. Ikki is #3, Koji is #2, and Space Medafighter X is #1. Ikki starts showing off for the cameras and Samantha (Leader of the Screws) claims that she taught Ikki all he knows.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220122.jpg"},{"title":"Enter Rintaro","synopsis":"Ikki and Erika go exploring when they find Spyke and Krosserdog attacked. They claim that a big Medabot attacked them. Afterwards, Samantha and other Medafighters blame Ikki for attacking their Medabots. They come to a conclusion that Metabee has been cloned.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, Koji is knitting a sock, because nobody has challenged him to a Ro-Battle.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220123.jpg"},{"title":"The Ace from Outer Space","synopsis":"As the story returns to where it left off last episode, we see the mysterious Medabot reveal itself. It is a KBT type, Arcbeetle, and it belongs to the number 1 Medafighter in Japan, Space Medafighter X. Space Medafighter X challenges Shrimpy Lipowitz and wins easily, winning back Ikki's medal. As he returns the medal, he lectures Ikki that he should never fight for medals, only medaparts.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220124.jpg"},{"title":"Me and My Shadow Sword","synopsis":"After seeing Ikki and Metabee use the Medaforce, Koji decides to train harder than ever to be prepared in case he ever has to face it. Space Medafighter X shows up to help him learn a special technique, the \"Shadow Sword\", which will help him to do this.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220125.jpg"},{"title":"Dude, Where`s My Ma?","synopsis":"Ikki and Metabee have to decide what to do. Do they want to make the rankings for the Medabots Ro-Battle Championships or does he want to save his mom?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220126.jpg"},{"title":"X-treme Measures","synopsis":"It's the day of the final standings for the World Robattle Tournaments and Ikki Tenryo is still in fourth place. With only 20 minutes until the closing of the rankings, Metabee is exhausted and the only new Medafighter nearby is Space Medafighter X.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220127.jpg"},null,null,{"title":"The Mother of All Robattles","synopsis":"Dr. Meta-Evil looks to be finished. But is he? A strange cat puts a rare medal in to a huge Medabot and it takes Metabee, Rokusho, and ArcBeetle to fight him. Even when all 3 of them use the Medaforce, it doesn't seem to stop Giganko. Giganko goes into town destroying everything in sight. Not even the Police can stop this Medabot. Is all hope lost?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76906/220130.jpg"},null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
